branch  ¦  10  ¦  parent-one  𝄀
branch  ¦  20  ¦  parent-two  𝄀
clone  ¦  10  ¦  parent-one  𝄀
clone  ¦  20  ¦  parent-two
select 'branch' as copy_kind, id, note
from bvt_issue_26127_branch.view_v
union all
select 'clone', id, note
from bvt_issue_26127_clone.view_v
order by copy_kind, id;
➤ copy_kind[12,-1,0]  ¦  id[4,32,0]  ¦  note[12,-1,0]  𝄀
branch  ¦  1  ¦  parent-one  𝄀
